---
import { ArrowRight, Binary, Check, CircleDot, Code2, FileText, Fingerprint, KeyRound, LockKeyhole } from "lucide-react";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const stack = ["Astro", "Tailwind", "TypeScript", "Pyodide", "Python"];
const cipherLines = ["7A 4F E1 09 C3", "2D B8 61 FF 0A", "93 1C D4 72 BE", "08 EA 35 A7 19", "F6 40 8B 2E C1"];
const rawBase = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const base = rawBase.endsWith("/") ? rawBase : `${rawBase}/`;
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main class="min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0908] text-[#f7f3ed]">
    <Header />

    <section class="relative isolate border-b border-orange-100/10">
      <div class="cipher-grid absolute inset-0 -z-20 opacity-40"></div>
      <div class="orange-halo absolute inset-0 -z-10"></div>
      <div class="mx-auto grid min-h-[720px] max-w-7xl items-end gap-14 px-5 pb-16 pt-32 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_0.92fr] lg:pb-24">
        <div>
          <div class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <span class="rounded-full border border-orange-300/30 bg-orange-300/10 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-orange-200">PORTAFOLIO · 2026</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-stone-500">Isaac Montoya Rodríguez</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-orange-400">Teoría · Algoritmos · Implementación</p>
          <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-balance text-[clamp(4rem,10vw,8.9rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.82] tracking-[-0.075em]">Cripto<span class="block text-orange-400">grafía.</span></h1>
          <div class="mt-10 grid max-w-3xl gap-7 border-l border-orange-400/55 pl-5 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-end sm:pl-7">
            <p class="max-w-xl text-pretty text-base leading-7 text-stone-300 sm:text-lg">Colección de prácticas desarrolladas durante el curso. Python se ejecuta directamente en el navegador para conservar cada implementación visible, independiente y fácil de probar.</p>
            <a href="#practicas" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-orange-400 px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-[#160d07] shadow-[0_0_38px_rgb(251_146_60/18%)] transition hover:bg-orange-300">Explorar índice <ArrowRight size={17} /></a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative mx-auto hidden aspect-square w-full max-w-[470px] lg:block" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="absolute inset-[5%] rounded-full border border-orange-200/15"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-[17%] rounded-full border border-dashed border-orange-300/25"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-[30%] rounded-full border border-orange-400/35"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-[43%] rounded-full bg-orange-400/10 shadow-[0_0_90px_rgb(251_146_60/16%)]"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-x-[14%] top-1/2 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-orange-300/40 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-y-[14%] left-1/2 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-orange-300/40 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 space-y-2 text-center font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.28em] text-orange-200/65">{cipherLines.map((line) => <p>{line}</p>)}</div>
          <span class="absolute right-[4%] top-[23%] font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest text-orange-300/60">SHA / KEY / IV</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="practicas" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28">
      <div class="mb-10 grid gap-6 border-b border-orange-100/10 pb-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.72fr] lg:items-end">
        <div><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-orange-400">Registro / 00—∞</p><h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-6xl">Archivo de prácticas</h2></div>
        <p class="max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500 lg:justify-self-end">Cada entrega aparece como una entrada de archivo: número, estado, objetivo y acceso en una sola línea.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-orange-100/10">
        <a href={`${base}practicas/00`} class="group grid gap-5 border-b border-orange-100/10 py-7 transition hover:bg-orange-400/[0.045] sm:px-4 md:grid-cols-[90px_150px_1fr_auto] md:items-center md:py-9">
          <span class="font-mono text-4xl font-light tracking-[-0.08em] text-orange-400">00</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-300"><Check size={14} /> Disponible</span>
          <div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition group-hover:text-orange-200 sm:text-2xl">Prueba Python en el navegador</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-stone-500">Inicialización de Pyodide, envío de texto y retorno del resultado a la interfaz.</p></div>
          <span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-orange-300/20 text-orange-300 transition group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:border-orange-300/60 group-hover:bg-orange-400 group-hover:text-[#160d07]"><ArrowRight size={20} /></span>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}practicas/01`} class="group grid gap-5 border-b border-orange-100/10 py-7 transition hover:bg-orange-400/[0.045] sm:px-4 md:grid-cols-[90px_150px_1fr_auto] md:items-center md:py-9">
          <span class="font-mono text-4xl font-light tracking-[-0.08em] text-stone-600">01</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-300"><Check size={14} /> Disponible</span>
          <div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition group-hover:text-orange-200 sm:text-2xl">Círculo relleno y desplazamiento RGB</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-stone-500">Crea un BMP relleno o carga otra imagen para desplazar sus canales de color entre 0 y 255.</p></div>
          <span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-orange-300/20 text-orange-300 transition group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:border-orange-300/60 group-hover:bg-orange-400 group-hover:text-[#160d07]"><CircleDot size={20} /></span>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}practicas/02`} class="group grid gap-5 border-b border-orange-100/10 py-7 transition hover:bg-orange-400/[0.045] sm:px-4 md:grid-cols-[90px_150px_1fr_auto] md:items-center md:py-9">
          <span class="font-mono text-4xl font-light tracking-[-0.08em] text-stone-600">02</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-300"><Check size={14} /> Disponible</span>
          <div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition group-hover:text-orange-200 sm:text-2xl">Cifrado César desde archivo TXT</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-stone-500">Carga texto, desplaza sus letras n posiciones y descarga la salida.</p></div>
          <span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-orange-300/20 text-orange-300 transition group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:border-orange-300/60 group-hover:bg-orange-400 group-hover:text-[#160d07]"><FileText size={20} /></span>
        </a>

        <div class="grid gap-5 border-b border-dashed border-orange-100/10 py-7 sm:px-4 md:grid-cols-[90px_150px_1fr_auto] md:items-center md:py-9">
          <span class="font-mono text-4xl font-light text-stone-800">+</span><span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-stone-700">Plantilla</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-stone-500">Preparado para nuevas entradas</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-700">Cada práctica futura reutilizará esta misma estructura.</p></div><Binary className="text-stone-700" size={20} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="arquitectura" class="border-y border-orange-100/10 bg-orange-300/[0.018]">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-5 py-16 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:items-center">
        <div><div class="mb-5 grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full border border-orange-300/25 bg-orange-300/10 text-orange-300"><Fingerprint size={20} /></div><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">Python, sin servidor.</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-stone-500">Pyodide ejecuta Python dentro del navegador mediante WebAssembly. La página permanece estática y puede publicarse desde GitHub.</p></div>
        <div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-orange-100/10 bg-orange-100/10 sm:grid-cols-5">{stack.map((item, index) => <div class="bg-[#0d0b09] px-5 py-6"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-700">0{index + 1}</span><p class="mt-8 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.11em] text-stone-300">{item}</p></div>)}</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-5 py-16 md:grid-cols-3 md:px-8">
      <article class="border-l border-orange-300/20 pl-5"><KeyRound className="text-orange-400" size={20} /><h3 class="mt-5 font-semibold text-stone-200">Algoritmos propios</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">Cada ejercicio conserva su código Python separado de la interfaz.</p></article>
      <article class="border-l border-orange-300/20 pl-5"><Code2 className="text-orange-400" size={20} /><h3 class="mt-5 font-semibold text-stone-200">Fácil de revisar</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">El profesor puede probar el resultado y consultar la implementación.</p></article>
      <article class="border-l border-orange-300/20 pl-5"><LockKeyhole className="text-orange-400" size={20} /><h3 class="mt-5 font-semibold text-stone-200">Listo para GitHub</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">La salida es un sitio estático que no requiere un backend activo.</p></article>
    </section>

    <footer class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-4 border-t border-orange-100/10 px-5 py-9 text-xs text-stone-600 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:px-8"><p>Criptografía · Portafolio académico</p><p class="font-mono">Isaac Montoya Rodríguez / 2026</p></footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
